charts/ is derived from the OAI Helm charts (https://gitlab.eurecom.fr/oai/orchestration/charts,
oai-5g-ran/oai-gnb 2.4.0, commit 7925f93). The chart is under the MIT License (LICENSE, LICENSES/MIT.txt), except
